window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Demons on the loose. Ritual murders. An ancient vampire breathing down her neck.</b></p> <p>Some days Max just doesn't know where to start. The problems facing her city are piling up, and there seems no end or solution in sight.</p> <p>Max's job used to be dealing with supernatural creatures. Now she's got to tackle demons from the underworld who are far more powerful than anything she's come across before, and who seem intent on bringing an end to the daylight world.</p> <p>Part of Max would love to sit this one out. Let someone else save the world for a change. But was it ever really a choice?</p> <p><i>Chosen</i> is the fifth and final book in The Grey Gates. If you like your fantasy mixed with a bit of mystery, a bit of magic, and a heroine who can hold her own, you'll love this new series by Vanessa Nelson.</p>"; 
